                                        "value": {
                                            "code": null,
                                            "comment": "",
                                            "message": "<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; padding-left: 16px;\">\n<li>Create an update set and record all changes made to the skipped records. This ensures that any resolutions are documented and can be easily tracked.</li>\n<li>Review Skipped Records: Examine each skipped record and decide which version to keep.</li>\n<li>Resolve Conflicts: Address any discrepancies between customizations and upgrade changes.</li>\n<li>Complete and Export Update Set: Finalize the update set and export it for future use.</li>\n</ul>"
